MailClient: show the thread when the folder is over message_list_limit

A folder with more messages than message_list_limit uses the limited
message list. That list ignores threadUid, so the thread view shows the
latest messages of the folder instead of the messages of the thread.
Use the threaded message list when a threadUid is given.

